       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIVROUND.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-NUM              PIC 9(4).
       01  WS-DEN              PIC 9(4).
       01  WS-RESULT           PIC 9(4).
       01  WS-LOG-STATUS       PIC X(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DIVIDE WS-NUM BY WS-DEN GIVING WS-RESULT ROUNDED.
           CALL "LOGRESULT" USING WS-RESULT WS-LOG-STATUS.
